{"4255100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veylora", "steam_appid": 4255100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Mike Harvey, a local investigator drawn into a series of disturbing missing persons cases.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple investigation leads you into a forest — and then far beyond it. Captured by unknown creatures, you wake up trapped inside a strange house where reality feels unstable and escape is never guaranteed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/3f5fdc604fb3bb9dceeee8d21df0812d.poster.avif?t=1787500100\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/3f5fdc604fb3bb9dceeee8d21df0812d.webm?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/3f5fdc604fb3bb9dceeee8d21df0812d.mp4?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on <strong>atmosphere, tension, and psychological horror</strong>, slowly revealing its story through exploration and environmental storytelling. The house hides dark secrets, and every step forward raises the question of whether the truth is worth uncovering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/cb282ec4e9dbd6cb54578e7ad59b891b.poster.avif?t=1787500100\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/cb282ec4e9dbd6cb54578e7ad59b891b.webm?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/cb282ec4e9dbd6cb54578e7ad59b891b.mp4?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious house filled with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere and constant tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative revealed through the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/9a29f8a691b85c69b5965d19897c5a27.poster.avif?t=1787500100\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/9a29f8a691b85c69b5965d19897c5a27.webm?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/9a29f8a691b85c69b5965d19897c5a27.mp4?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They will get you eventually...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><br><br><br></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Mike Harvey, a local investigator drawn into a series of disturbing missing persons cases.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple investigation leads you into a forest — and then far beyond it. Captured by unknown creatures, you wake up trapped inside a strange house where reality feels unstable and escape is never guaranteed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/3f5fdc604fb3bb9dceeee8d21df0812d.poster.avif?t=1787500100\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/3f5fdc604fb3bb9dceeee8d21df0812d.webm?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/3f5fdc604fb3bb9dceeee8d21df0812d.mp4?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on <strong>atmosphere, tension, and psychological horror</strong>, slowly revealing its story through exploration and environmental storytelling. The house hides dark secrets, and every step forward raises the question of whether the truth is worth uncovering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/cb282ec4e9dbd6cb54578e7ad59b891b.poster.avif?t=1787500100\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/cb282ec4e9dbd6cb54578e7ad59b891b.webm?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/cb282ec4e9dbd6cb54578e7ad59b891b.mp4?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious house filled with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere and constant tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative revealed through the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/9a29f8a691b85c69b5965d19897c5a27.poster.avif?t=1787500100\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/9a29f8a691b85c69b5965d19897c5a27.webm?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/extras/9a29f8a691b85c69b5965d19897c5a27.mp4?t=1787500100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They will get you eventually...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><br><br><br></p>", "short_description": "You play as Mike Harvey, a local investigator searching for answers behind multiple missing persons cases. The trail leads into a forest — but it doesn’t end there. Taken by unknown creatures, you awaken inside a strange house. The shadows are watching. Escape is not guaranteed.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Czech<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255100/610e682db39e27f68912cc9e2cbc68adeeb26b2d/header.jpg?t=1787500100", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/425